WEBVTT

00:20:27.704 --> 00:20:31.163
But when we think about a system that is
like a thousand times more powerful

00:20:31.496 --> 00:20:33.621
and let's say a million
times more reliable,

00:20:33.788 --> 00:20:36.913
it just doesn't it doesn't
say gibberish very often.

00:20:36.913 --> 00:20:39.663
It doesn't totally lose the
plot and get distracted

00:20:39.871 --> 00:20:43.246
or system like that is going to be one
that a lot of the economic activity in

00:20:43.246 --> 00:20:44.579
the world comes to rely on.

00:20:45.246 --> 00:20:48.996
And I think it's very important
that we don't have

00:20:48.996 --> 00:20:52.996
a small group of people sort of saying you
can never use it for this thing that,

00:20:53.038 --> 00:20:55.121
like most of the world
wants to use it for

00:20:55.704 --> 00:20:57.621
because it doesn't match
our personal beliefs.

00:20:59.079 --> 00:21:01.079
Talk a bit more about some
of the other uses of it,